  "description": "Captus gives you the kind of e-bike tech you’d associate with a bigger price tag. It’s powered by a Bosch e-system with a 400Wh battery and Active Line motor, built to handle city commutes, weekend rides, and everything in between. In other words: reliable, proven, and economical. You get proper kit too - hydraulic disc brakes, Shimano 9-speed gears, front and rear lights, full mudguards, and pannier rack capable of holding 27kg. 700C wheels roll smoothly and efficiently, whether you're casually cruising through traffic or trying to beat the rain home. The Captus low-step frame comes equipped with a 50mm front suspension fork, adding extra comfort when the road surface isn’t playing nice. It’s a great option if you want a smooth, cushioned ride for everyday commutes or longer weekend trips. If you want premium performance without the premium price tag, this is it. No gimmicks. Just a well-made e-bike that does what it says on the tin - and then some. Range Calculator Use this calculator to better estimate the range you might achieve based on your riding conditions: Bosch Ebike Calculator (Please check the specification to ensure your select the correct motor and battery. The total travel distance will depend on the capacity of the battery, rider and luggage weight, power mode setting and riding style.) Important Please be aware that this bike is regulated in line with existing Electric Power Assisted Cycles regulations. Any modification to the bike will invalidate the guarantee and in particular any modification which increases the power of the motor and/or the top assisted speed of the bike may make the rider liable to prosecution. Excluding statutory obligations Raleigh will not be held responsible for any injuries incurred following any modification to this product.",
